{"path":"container/flat_multiset/insert_range","title":"std::flat_multiset<Key,Compare,KeyContainer>::insert_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::flat_multiset&lt;Key,Compare,KeyContainer&gt;::</span>insert_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_multiset/insert_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts a copy of each element in the range rg into underlying container c as if by:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>value_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> insert_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts a copy of each element in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> into underlying container <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multiset#Member_objects\"><code><i>c</i></code></a> as if by:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    c.<span class=\"me1\">insert</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, e<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>Then, sorts the range of newly inserted elements with respect to <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multiset#Member_objects\"><code><i>compare</i></code></a>.\nMerges the resulting sorted range and the sorted range of pre-existing elements into a single sorted range.\n</p><p>Each iterator in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced exactly once.\nThe behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> overlaps with the container.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">Information on iterator invalidation is copied from <a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/Template:cpp/container/note_iterator_invalidation\" data-external=\"1\">here</a> </div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>, that is, an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> whose elements are convertible to <code>T</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">N <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> M·log<span class=\"br0\">(</span>M<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>N</code> is <span class=\"t-lc\">size()</span> before the operation and <code>M</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/distance\"><span class=\"kw3160\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Since <code>insert_range</code> performs an in-place merge operation, that may allocate memory.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;flat_set&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> elem <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> elem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> container <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multiset\"><span class=\"kw3361\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_multiset</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rg <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#ifdef __cpp_lib_containers_ranges</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">insert_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">insert</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rg.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, container<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>-2 -1 1 2 3 3 4</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multiset/insert\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts elements  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/flat_multiset","title":"std::flat_multiset"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::flat_multiset<Key,Compare,KeyContainer>::insert_range","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Inserts a copy of each element in the range rg into underlying container c as if by:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"N + M·log(M), where N is size() before the operation and M is ranges::distance(rg)."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Since insert_range performs an in-place merge operation, that may allocate memory."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"insert","note":"inserts elements"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":209,"codeBlockCount":3}
